Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music][Drumbeats Continue]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music] [Singing In Native Dialect]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, swing.\NThat's it, swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice and level.\NPut it in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.93,0:03:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native Dialect]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run! Wrong way!\NFirst! First!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong way!\NOther way! Other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!\NHold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Man] Telephony!\NHey! Telephony! U.S.!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[Indistinct Chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are great natural athletes.\NJerry, they're developing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,their own unique style\Nof baseball here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I could file on African baseball\Non a regular basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Maybe, you know, do a feature or...\N- Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But enough of these\NAfrican baseball stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,George, there's an opening\Non the sports desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How soon can you and\NSuzy get back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, about a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- When, when do you want me to start?\N- Hey, man, we need you by Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want the job or not?\N- Yeah! Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the cheeseburgers ready, Jerry,\Nbecause I'm gonna be home by Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thanks a lot, buddy.\N- See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!\NOoow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Whistle] Susan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got real news!\NWait till I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna miss Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's downright Jurassic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth or fifth cervical\Nvertebra, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a neck structure\Nof a brontosaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Small head, slender neural cord.\N- Let's carbon-date it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- We could.\N- I'll get it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris or London?\NShall I send a telex?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- You could.\N- What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This bone is about 80 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in showing\Nme that, Susan, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote it.\NDon't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This, I think, is more what\Nyou should be looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Or am I just a total idiot?\N- On the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the brightest\Npost-doc we've had out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- I thought I really had something.\N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- I thought I really had something.\N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Susan, may I speak with you?\N- Hello, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that your wife has had a\Nslight scientific disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You all right?\N- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to find something\Nreal important before I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Susan, you know that most field\Nwork is patience and frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're young.\NDon't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.100,0:06:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, some days you eat the\Nbone; other days, the bone eats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Nigel. Ready to\Nsharpen his pencils today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Must you always be sarcastic?\N- Au revoir, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Little Miss\NScientist's latest discovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,From Bateke. She's top-notch\Nat her job, Nigel...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.49,0:06:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,whether you like her or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is it any good?\N- I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't patronize me, Eric,\Nplease. I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How good is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[Eric] She knows nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If these scrapings are from Bateke,\NI imagine the photo is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- A trip is indicated.\N- You do know that Etienne is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, terrible thing.\NFine scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you going to\Ntell her that we're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,going to Bateke because\Nof her scrapings?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not, and neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, the beer that made\NOgbomosho famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that? I can finally say\N"Ogbomosho," and we're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Post is really\Nlucky to get you. It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll write. I promise.\N- Do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good morning.\N- Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about your husband's job.\NCongratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It should suit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I can\Nhelp you in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You choose any school\Nor museum you like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll get the highest\Npossible recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NI really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing before you go. Dr. Pierre\NDubois from the Red Cross...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,is in the lab office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you have a chat\Nwith him before you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chanting Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where? Where upriver?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,George, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should bloody well tell me my\Nmessages as they come in. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not okay. You make\Nthings very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently your favorite\Npost-doc and her husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,are now chasing their bone\Nat a Sangha village upriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where did you get that information?\N- Dubois.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Red Cross.\N- Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it!\NWe're at the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me government house.\NTommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is going on?\N- You'll find out in due course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to need\Na boat and an escort. Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a persistent\Nlittle devil, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is where they left the\Ncarcass, then it should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have washed with the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to look over there.\NWhat's downriver?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Charlie.\N[Speaking Native Dialect]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.\NYou won't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Kenge Obe\Ncommunications module.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a transceiver.\NThere's a transmitter chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can... You can\Nbeep each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the wraps and radio,\Nplus this excellent guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Rent or buy? Food is extra. I'll be\Nback to pick you up in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it a rental and\Ntell him he goes with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Charlie.\N[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Native]\N- [Protesting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[Susan]\NOh, my God! George.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are ya going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"No problem."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Something big's been through here.\NLook at those broken branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- George?\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello?\N- [Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:13:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Native]\N- [Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Amigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yelling, Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,George, maybe you should\Ngive them something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- We would like to give you a gift.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like\Nme to give them, Susan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Show it.\NShow them how it ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't tick. It's\Na goddamn digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it anyway, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- You like my watch?\N- [Beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[Beeping Continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[Beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have any other ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[George] Oh, terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'd like my... pants.\NIt's what they could use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[George] Susan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Susan! Don't! Their soul!\N- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.\NCome on, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[Woman Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.15,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Think happy thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it either, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm George.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- My name, George.\N- Cephu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[Native]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Near beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's near enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[Susan] George?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind's at his back.\NHe can't get our scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need pictures.\NGet my camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[Camera Clicking]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- George, look.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the female.\N- How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,George, it's a hatchling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.\NIt really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take pictures.\NTake pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking at\N150 million years ago. My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.100,0:18:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize you're gonna be the\Nmost famous scientist in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand is what\Nthey're doing this far south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand is\Nwhat they're doing alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Maybe they ran out of this\Nfruit where they used to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Think that's enough?\N- Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Following the food supply.\NYou know, George, that's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- I guess we can get a little closer.\N- You know what we've got to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them\Nused to us so we can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,stick one of Kenge's\Nradio chips on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump back, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo! Look at you! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- George of the jungle.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Growling]\N- Chow time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting used to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. They love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[George]\NThat's it, guys. Pig out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[Cooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. Behind you.\NThe baby. Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can put the transmitter on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! Hey, you! Leave that alone.\N- [Braying]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Susan, he's got big teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.91,0:20:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Squawking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- You see him?\N- He's underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,On the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,George? George?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Baby, it's all right.\NIt's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,God, George, you scared her.\NNo, no, no, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Real funny.\N- Come on, it's okay. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Some food. Come on.\NNo, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, here, here. No, no, come on.\NHungry? Free meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.15,0:21:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you.\NAre you friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.69,0:21:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, don't step on me.\NCame to visit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a little\Nelephant, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.02,0:22:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's playing.\NDinosaurs don't play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's weird.\N- Isn't her skin nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be more scaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not so bad.\NYou're kind of friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.\NIt's all right. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[Chanting]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:47.100,Default,,0,0,0,,[Growling In Time With The Chanting]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Growling]\N- Don't do that, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[Eric] Oh, my God, she's had\Nmore than 200 CCs already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you blockhead!\NTake the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- She'll have to have a stimulant.\N- I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You must excuse my\Nassistant, my dear Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm, I'm beginning\Nto take an active interest...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.76,0:23:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,in your career and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.23,0:23:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you know I have\Nthe aid of the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.87,0:23:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I should like to\Nsee you "General" Nsogbu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For all our sakes, we mustn't\Nlose this one, must we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.94,0:24:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose one, you keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I call that acceptable\Nlosses, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[Moaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[Growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Whimpering]\N- What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you still hungry?\N- [Groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.70,0:24:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She already ate 200 pounds\Nof of malumbo fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.34,0:24:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.34,0:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you had to make\Nsuch a pig of yourself, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.18,0:24:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay?\N- [Groan]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.50,0:25:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[Whining]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[George] Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.17,0:25:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him outta here.\NOw! Get off my toe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.67,0:25:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, get off my foot!\N- She's not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a baby.\NIt'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, what breath!\N- Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.95,0:25:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[George] Good God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, George. Come on!\N- Heave, heave!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.53,0:25:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[Groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.45,0:25:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nifty. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Still hurts, huh?\N- Look at the size of this sucker, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[George] Oh, yeah, that feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.94,0:26:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- You like that, huh?\N- Work your way up right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Up, up, now to your left.\NRight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.72,0:26:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Cooing]\N- Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Baby.\NCome on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.49,0:26:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not now. Go on, go on.\N- No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.84,0:26:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[Cooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.29,0:27:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,George, Baby...\NWhere's Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.99,0:27:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.19,0:27:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God!\N- I'm sure she's right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.90,0:27:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.87,0:27:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how she'll\Nfeed herself, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't reach the malumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.61,0:27:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.53,0:27:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Beeping]\N- Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got something here.\N- Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Beeping]\N- Yeah, she's over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.91,0:28:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,George.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.07,0:28:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[Cooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.24,0:28:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[Contented Growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- [Grunting]\N- Baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.11,0:29:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.41,0:29:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let it be.\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[Braying]